6. Animation Flags Reference
From AnimBlendAssociation.h:19-41:
| Flag | Value | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|
| ANIMATION_IS_PLAYING | 0x01 | Currently advancing time |
| ANIMATION_IS_LOOPED | 0x02 | Loops when finished |
| ANIMATION_IS_BLEND_AUTO_REMOVE | 0x04 | Delete when m_BlendAmount <= 0 |
| ANIMATION_IS_FINISH_AUTO_REMOVE | 0x08 | Start fading out when finished |
| ANIMATION_IS_PARTIAL | 0x10 | Overlay animation (smoking, gestures) |
| ANIMATION_IS_SYNCRONISED | 0x20 | Sync with movement anims |
| ANIMATION_CAN_EXTRACT_VELOCITY | 0x40 | Use Y translation for movement |
| ANIMATION_CAN_EXTRACT_X_VELOCITY | 0x80 | Use X translation too |
| ANIMATION_FACIAL | 0x8000 | Never destroy (facial expressions) |
